w the","words":[["should",73.5,73.68],["check",73.68,73.94],["with",73.94,74.06],["the",74.06,74.18],["staff",74.18,74.46],["at",74.46,74.62],["the",74.62,74.72],["center",74.72,75.06],["before",75.06,75.38],["applying",75.38,75.84],["for",75.84,76.06],["a",76.06,76.16],["job.",76.16,76.46],["Right.",77.36,77.58],["Now",78.32,78.58],["the",78.58,78.72]]},{"start":78.72,"end":81.6,"text":"The university has its own job center on the campus.","words":[["The",78.72,78.78],["university",78.78,79.04],["has",79.04,79.66],["its",79.66,79.84],["own",79.84,80.1],["job",80.1,80.36],["center",80.36,80.76],["on",80.76,81.14],["the",81.14,81.28],["campus.",81.28,81.6]]},{"start":82.34,"end":87.94,"text":"Well, actually, it's not on this main Hillston campus, it's based in the Student Services","words":[["Well,",82.34,82.52],["actually,",82.76,83.14],["it's",83.4,83.52],["not",83.52,83.68],["on",83.68,83.9],["this",83.9,84.12],["main",84.12,84.52],["Hillston",84.52,85.28],["campus,",85.28,85.76],["it's",86.1,86.5],["based",86.5,86.72],["in",86.72,86.96],["the",86.96,87.1],["Student",87.1,87.38],["Services",87.38,87.94]]},{"start":87.94,"end":97.02,"text":"Building on the campus called Woodside, spelt W-O-O-D-S-I-D-E.","words":[["Building",87.94,88.52],["on",88.52,89.12],["the",89.12,89.26],["campus",89.26,89.62],["called",89.62,90.14],["Woodside,",90.14,91.02],["spelt",91.56,92.04],["W",92.04,92.74],["-O",92.74,93.64],["-O",93.64,94.12],["-D",94.12,94.84],["-S",94.84,95.58],["-I",95.58,96.08],["-D",96.08,96.62],["-E.",96.62,97.02]]},{"start":97.66,"end":102.08,"text":"The center works on a drop-in basis, which means that you don't have to make an appointment.","words":[["The",97.66,98.02],["center",98.02,98.32],["works",98.32,98.62],["on",98.62,98.84],["a",98.84,99.0],["drop",99.0,99.2],["-in",99.2,99.38],["basis,",99.38,99.78],["which",100.12,100.5],["means",100.5,100.76],["that",100.76,100.94],["you",100.94,101.04],["don't",101.04,101.2],["have",101.2,101.38],["to",101.38,101.5